      "id": "body_text",
      "label": "Body content",
      "default": "<p>In 1975, Mangal Royal Jewels was founded on two things that cannot be bought — trust and craftsmanship. For decades, families across generations have walked through our doors and left carrying more than jewellery. They carried a piece of an institution that truly understood what fine jewellery means: not just the weight of gold or the clarity of stone, but the weight of emotion and the clarity of occasion.</p><p>Mangal Royal Studio is the next chapter of this story. Born from the same house, informed by the same values — but designed for a new generation of discerning, conscious and deeply personal luxury.</p><p>Every piece at Mangal Royal Studio is designed to celebrate emotions, milestones and everyday luxury in a way that feels timeless yet deeply relevant to who you are today.</p>"
